{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124173","id":5709516134,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGrEDDw","number":124173,"title":"[iOS] fix `on_focus_in()` starting the CoreAudio driver when dummy driver is active","user":{"login":"xSStephen","id":70861285,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODYxMjg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70861285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen","html_url":"https://github.com/xSStephen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSStephen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-10-05T09:21:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T18:43:37Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T18:43:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124173","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124173.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124173.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-08T18:43:21Z"},"body":"Fixing #120842 \r\nIf Core Audio fails to start at launch, Godot falls back to the dummy driver, but the audio unit is left behind. The next time the app comes to the foreground, on_focus_in() starts that unit anyway. The dummy mix thread and the Core Audio render callback then both run AudioServer::_mix_step(), and the game crashes. The same start happens when an audio interruption ends.\r\n\r\naudio_driver_start() and audio_driver_stop() now touch the Core Audio driver only when it is the active one. Focus in and focus out go through those methods, so the interruption path is covered too.\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n`void OS_AppleEmbedded::audio_driver_start() {\r\n\tif (AudioDriver::get_singleton() == &audio_driver) {\r\n\t\taudio_driver.start();\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid OS_AppleEmbedded::audio_driver_stop() {\r\n\tif (AudioDriver::get_singleton() == &audio_driver) {\r\n\t\taudio_driver.stop();\r\n\t}\r\n}`\r\n```\r\ninit() also disposes the unit on failure and sets audio_unit to null, so a later start() is a no-op even if something calls it directly. That includes input init failing after the output unit was already created.\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\nif (GLOBAL_GET(\"audio/driver/enable_input\")) {\r\n\tError input_err = init_input_device();\r\n\tif (input_err != OK) {\r\n\t\tfinish_input_device();\r\n\t\t_release_output_unit();\r\n\t\treturn input_err;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\nA normal launch is unchanged. If init failed, that session stays silent until the next cold start. This does not try to bring Core Audio back on foreground, because the dummy thread would still be mixing.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124173/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}